  "result": "`acceptInvitation` in `src/server/services/invitation-service.ts` never looked at `revokedAt`. It refused already-accepted and expired invitations but let a cancelled one through, so the link still created a membership. I added a check that throws \"That invitation has been revoked\" when `revokedAt` is set. It sits right after the already-accepted check and before the expiry check.\n\nThe revoke side was already correct: `revokeInvitation` in the repository sets `revokedAt`. I didn't run the test suite or add a test for the revoked case.",
